# =========================
# PeerPass - Root .gitignore
# =========================
# ---------- Reference-only trees ----------
# legacy/ is a pre-Flutter-scaffold layout sketch. It has no pubspec.yaml and
# cannot be built, so it is intentionally never tracked. Declared explicitly so
# the exclusion does not depend on the Python `lib/` rule further down.
legacy/

# ---------- Agent tooling ----------
# .agents/ holds skill definitions for coding agents. They are development
# tooling rather than part of the application: no build, test, or deploy step
# reads them, and every one of them is also published upstream. Untracked so a
# clone carries only what runs, and so the tool's own churn does not land in the
# app's history. The skills stay on disk for anyone who wants them locally.
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# ---------- OS generated ----------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

